sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant AD as Admin UI
  participant R as routes/admin/pm
  participant PS as PmService
  participant CR as CoinRepo
  participant PR as PmPieceRepo
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant AU as Audit

  AD->>R: POST /api/admin/pm (新建，默认 draft)
  R->>R: requireAdmin()
  R->>PS: createSet(payload, actor)
  PS->>PS: validate(payload) 必填与条件必填
  alt 校验失败
    PS-->>R: ok=false, error, field
    R-->>AD: 400 字段级错误
  else 校验通过
    PS->>CR: nextNo() + insert(data)
    CR->>DB: BEGIN; SELECT MAX(no) FOR UPDATE; INSERT cl_coins; COMMIT
    DB-->>CR: newNo = 138
    CR-->>PS: CoinRow
    PS->>PR: replaceAll(138, pieces)
    PR->>DB: DELETE + INSERT cl_pm_pieces（同事务）
    PS->>AU: log(actor, pm.create, 138, 15 枚, ip)
    PS->>PS: bumpCatalogRev() 使 60s 缓存失效
    PS-->>R: CoinRow
    R-->>AD: 200 ok=true, coin
  end

  AD->>R: POST /api/admin/pm/138/status (published)
  R->>PS: publish(138, actor)
  PS->>PS: 断言 verified=1 且 pieces 行数 = set_pieces
  PS->>CR: setStatus(138, published)
  CR->>DB: UPDATE cl_coins SET status=? WHERE no=138
  PS->>AU: log(actor, pm.publish, 138)
  PS-->>R: CoinRow
  R-->>AD: 200 ok=true
